  "bullets": [
    "Volumes: Heart + liver + lung (Strata's core flying organs) rose 13.4% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart, liver, lung and kidney rose 6.6%, 14.5%, 18.9% and 3.3%.",
    "Quarter: Q3 heart+liver+lung \u25b2 5.2% YoY; \u25bc 5.8% vs Q2 (typical Q2\u2192Q3: \u25bc 4.2%).",
    "Donors: Deceased donors recovered rose 3.5% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year, and 20.5% of recovered organs have been discarded so far this year (19.7% a year earlier).",
    "Donor mix & distance: DCD donors are 53.5% of deceased donors so far this year, up from 49.2% in 2025; the share of organs travelling 251+ NM fell for liver and lung and held steady for the rest.",
    "Waitlist: Heart+liver+lung waitlist additions were roughly flat (+1.9%) over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart and liver were roughly flat (-1.3%, +2.0%); lung rose 6.8%; kidney fell 3.1%.",
    "Regions: biggest moves over the last 4 weeks vs. last year: Mid-Atlantic (Region 2) \u25b2 21.4%, Northwest (Region 6) \u25b2 20.5%, New York (Region 9) \u25b2 12.8%."
  ],
